OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts on 'anchor' cancer
OL,4,Asupport centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FTalking about the time after Andrew's
OL,7,Fdeath, Sore said: "I was numb some
OL,8,Fdays, but I was just able to chat to
OL,9,Fthem and they were listening to me...
OL,10,Fand I could just be myself and I felt
OL,11,Fsafe when I went there."
